A figure of speech in which opposite effects are shown to be produced
 from the same cause or by the same agency; it is thus defined by Mammaṭa:
 -तद्यथा साधितं केनाप्यपरेण तदन्यथा । तथैव यद्विधीयेत स व्याघात

